# IRONMAN

> IRONMAN is the world's largest triathlon organization, producing full-distance IRONMAN, half-distance IRONMAN 70.3, and Short Course triathlon events across 55+ countries. Owned by Advance, operated by The IRONMAN Group.

## Main Sections

- [News](https://www.ironman.com/news): Race recaps, athlete stories, announcements, and triathlon community updates
- [Races](https://www.ironman.com/races): Search and register for IRONMAN and IRONMAN 70.3 events worldwide by location, date, and distance
- [Pro Series](https://www.ironman.com/proseries): Professional triathlete competition series with standings, race schedule, and athlete profiles
- [Training](https://www.ironman.com/training): Coaching plans, nutrition guidance, and race preparation for beginners through experienced athletes
- [Community](https://www.ironman.com/community): TriClubs, Women for Tri initiative, and All World Athlete ranking program
- [Resources](https://www.ironman.com/resources): Competition rules, SMART program, anti-doping policies, and athlete guides
- [About](https://www.ironman.com/about): IRONMAN Group corporate information, Foundation, careers, series partners
- [Athlete Profiles](https://www.ironman.com/proseries/triathletes): Professional triathlete pages with race results, bios, and competition history

## Optional

- [Sitemap](https://www.ironman.com/sitemap.xml): XML sitemap index with all indexed pages
